# Visual QA

The user handles all visual QA. Do not take screenshots, screen recordings, or run browser/computer-use verification for UI appearance.

- After UI work: build/typecheck if needed, commit, push, update the PR, then stop.
- Do not use RecordScreen, computerUse, or walkthrough screenshot/video artifacts unless the user explicitly asks in that turn.
- Prefer shipping the change over proving it visually.
